agent-keyboard
Copyright (C) 2026

This program reimplements the ASUS Aura TUF keyboard HID Direct protocol
for the ROG Strix Scope II RX / NX. The protocol bytes, 15-LED packet
framing, and 107-LED key-id table were documented by:

  OpenRGB  AsusAuraTUFKeyboardController  (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  https://gitlab.com/CalcProgrammer1/OpenRGB

  RSS_II_RGB  (GPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/bbfox0703/RSS_II_RGB

Those projects remain the protocol references. This tree is a Mac-native
Agent status dashboard that talks to the same HID control collection
(usage page 0xFF00, interface 1) via hidapi / IOKit.

